{"name": "Wildgate", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wildgate is a PvPvE multiplayer shooter with 3 different modes. In Artifact Brawl, be the first to snatch the Artifact and blast through the Wildgate, or destroy the ships of every rival crew to be crowned the winner. Fleet Battle pits two massive teams of up to 12 players each against one another in relentless, action-packed combat. For a more relaxed looting expedition, salvage treasure and escape with the spoils before getting blown up in Treasure Hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across all modes your ship is your home and lifeline for you and your prospector crew. Keep it topped up with ice, fuel and ammo so you're ready for anyone or anything the Reach throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"70\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/58c4d846d0f8897282f9c975964f3172.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/58c4d846d0f8897282f9c975964f3172.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"257\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/af1fe9ea43d41c6d585ab94c9ee1dc3d.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/af1fe9ea43d41c6d585ab94c9ee1dc3d.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your enemies with hi-tech cannons and gadgets, lure them into deadly traps, or even mess with their ship... as long as they don't sabotage yours first. When your perfect plan goes out the airlock, there's only one option... wing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"70\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/8ccf53ab4b7d59a4789a29662921ab36.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/8ccf53ab4b7d59a4789a29662921ab36.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"257\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/937382e65aee48d964f57b1b343745de.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/937382e65aee48d964f57b1b343745de.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay one step ahead as you and your crew navigate the Reach \u2014 a vast, ever-changing procedurally-generated map that changes with every game.<br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"70\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/2013515a9ef288463fb70ed8b4c531c0.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/2013515a9ef288463fb70ed8b4c531c0.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"257\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/518e3447cd67bef77ba1cb9f27b32546.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/518e3447cd67bef77ba1cb9f27b32546.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of daring prospectors, each with their own abilities and tools. Whether you want to be a brave pilot holding down the ship or a clever trickster boarding enemy ships, there's no wrong way to commit space crimes!<br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"70\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/f219b8d5ffc1bfbb0f76088738aaa88e.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/f219b8d5ffc1bfbb0f76088738aaa88e.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"257\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/3fb6cd7b8248392a6250ee5f890f8b40.poster.avif?t=1787942042\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/extras/3fb6cd7b8248392a6250ee5f890f8b40.webm?t=1787942042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Reach is a dangerous, unpredictable place, filled with deadly hazards and treasure beyond your wildest dreams. Navigate through cosmic storms, battle space creatures, and plunder ancient alien ruins for lost caches of loot. Just make sure you beat the other prospectors to the punch, or you'll fly away empty-handed!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wildgate is a PvPvE multiplayer shooter that blends tactical ship-to-ship combat with fast-paced first-person action. Evade deadly environmental hazards, search for powerful weapons and ship upgrades, and be the first crew to escape with the Artifact... or the last crew left flying.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504780/95f1381dac57ce601d5260de3c792f8a2ee2bc93/header.jpg?t=1787942042", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "PvP", "Space", "Adventure", "FPS", "Co-op"], "developers": "Moonshot Games", "publishers": "Moonshot Games", "release_date": "Jul 22, 2025", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3504780", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 May 2025 - Request Access\n\n7 June 2025 - Demo / Open Beta", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NvTYnjkPeLQ", "first_seen": 1746748800.0, "review_rank": 1687}